--   * L8 LieAlgebra.Morphism (Lie homomorphism layer)
--   * L11-L13 root system / Cartan type bridge (the discrete side
--     of Coxeter ↔ Lie correspondence)
--   * L14 sl₂, L15 so₃ (concrete small-rank Lie algebras)
--   * L18 UniversalEnvelopingAlgebra (the right-adjoint to the
--     forgetful Assoc → Lie functor; gives the substrate's first
--     real adjunction at the algebra level)
--   * L19 MonsterLieAlgebra (Borcherds 1992 V♮-graded Lie algebra)
--
-- After L2: substrate has both commutative (CNAA / X3) and anti-
